  "headline": "FDA's shortage list shows two manufacturers discontinuing mesalamine extended-release capsules in 2026; our three sites all use Zydus Lifesciences Limited (FEI 3007938603) which has only VAI inspections on record",
  "headline_cites": ["E10", "E11", "E1", "E2", "E3", "E9"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list records Mylan Pharmaceuticals Inc. posting a discontinuation of mesalamine extended-release capsules on 2026-08-25 and Takeda Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. posting a discontinuation on 2026-09-16.",
      "cites": ["E10", "E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "All three Corvale sites (East, General, Lakeside) stock the same NDC 70771162507 labeled by Zydus Lifesciences Limited with SPL set ID 04073681-a834-4f45-91c5-224b608b30e6.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2", "E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Zydus manufacturing site (FEI 3007938603) shows only Voluntary Action Indicated (VAI) inspections from 2015 through 2023-03-24 with no Official Action Indicated classifications in FDA's posted records.",
      "cites": ["E4", "E5", "E6", "E7", "E8", "E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 49 units on hand at 9.0 units per day (5 days supply), Corvale General has 163 units at 9.6 units per day (17 days supply), and Corvale Lakeside has 50 units at 1.8 units per day (27 days supply).",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Transferring 24 units from Corvale Lakeside to Corvale East would leave Lakeside with 26 units (14 days supply) and bring East to 73 units (8 days supply), per the calculated transfer plan.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because the FDA shortage list cites manufacturer discontinuations rather than Zydus-specific actions, and Zydus inspection records show only VAI findings, verify whether Zydus supply allocations are changing and confirm the transfer with both pharmacy managers.",
      "cites": ["E10", "E11", "E4", "E5", "E6", "E7", "E8", "E9"]
    }
  ]
}
